      "revision": 1351738834,
      "text": "Lobularia maritima is a species of low-growing flowering plant in the family Brassicaceae. Its common name is sweet alyssum or sweet Alison, also commonly referred to as just alyssum."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Lobularia maritima",
